  "description": {
   "en": "The girl Elna, an adopted daughter of a baron’s family, lived a life full of hardship and mistreatment.\nBut in the midst of her suffering, she suddenly regained memories of her previous life—as the dragon who once protected the kingdom.\nCarrying the memories of her adventures with the hero she used to fly on her back, she heads to the royal palace, where she meets the young king Cross.\nIn that moment, Elna realizes that he is the very same hero—reborn by the hands of fate…"
  },
